{"k":{"t01-apar-0":"<span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"12.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">LEABHRÁN MÍNIÚCHÁIN</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"8.4pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">DO</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">tháblaí cabhracha Delmas</span> <span class=\"orn\">❦</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"13.2pt\" data-rolo=\"serio\">AN CHÉAD SHRAITH</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-apar-1":"<span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.0pt\" data-rolo=\"nom\">TÁBLA Uimh. 1</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"11.4pt\" data-rolo=\"tit\">An Scoil. — An Ardscoil. — An Rang.</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-tit-1":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Cur síos ginearálta.</span>","t01-01-1":"1. — Sa tábla seo léirítear <b>rang</b> in <b>ardscoil</b>. Sa rang seo tá ocht <b>mbord</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.339325,0.560105,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"18\" title=\"mbord\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(18)</sup></button> agus ocht <b>mbinse</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.298491,0.886341,0.009543,0.012447\" data-n=\"32\" title=\"mbinse\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(32)</sup></button>. Ar gach binse suíonn triúr dalta. Suíonn an <b>múinteoir</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.104527,0.503767,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"7\" title=\"múinteoir\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(7)</sup></button> ar <b>chathaoir</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.072792,0.542745,0.00466,0.012119\" data-n=\"8\" title=\"chathaoir\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(8)</sup></button> taobh thiar dá <b>dheasc</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.134043,0.602358,0.00466,0.011137\" data-n=\"6\" title=\"dheasc\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(6)</sup></button>.","t01-02-1":"2. — Ar chlé na deisce tá <b>cófra</b> gloine <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"fhisic\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button>. Ar dheis tá an <b>clár dubh</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.016644,0.59679,0.003329,0.010481\" data-n=\"1\" title=\"clár dubh\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(1)</sup></button> lena <b>cheirt</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.034842,0.685228,0.005548,0.010154\" data-n=\"2\" title=\"cheirt\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(2)</sup></button> agus lena <b>chailc</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.055704,0.744186,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"3\" title=\"chailc\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(3)</sup></button>.","t01-02-2":"Os cionn na deisce tá <b>táblaí balla</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.042166,0.4887,0.00466,0.010481\" data-n=\"9\" title=\"táblaí balla\" aria-expanded=\"false\">9</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"táblaí balla\" aria-expanded=\"false\">11</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"táblaí balla\" aria-expanded=\"false\">12</button>)</sup> agus <b>léarscáil</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.117843,0.250901,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"10\" title=\"léarscáil\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(10)</sup></button> ar crochadh.","t01-03-1":"3. — Níl na daltaí uile ina <b>n-áiteanna</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.290945,0.528005,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"17\" title=\"n-áiteanna\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(17)</sup></button>. Tá Eoin <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.006658,0.712414,0.00577,0.010481\" data-n=\"4\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(4)</sup></button> ina sheasamh ag an gclár; tá an cheirt ina láimh aige agus tá sé ag glanadh na <b>bhfíoracha geoiméadracha</b>.","t01-03-2":"Tá Peadar ina sheasamh ag an deasc; tá sé ag bailiú na <b>gcleachtaí scríofa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.092543,0.64756,0.005104,0.010809\" data-n=\"5\" title=\"gcleachtaí scríofa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(5)</sup></button> chun iad a thabhairt don mhúinteoir.","t01-04-1":"4. — Is múinteoir <b>teangacha nua-aimseartha</b> é an múinteoir seo. Múineann sé do na daltaí conas labhairt, léamh agus scríobh i dteangacha iasachta <b>(Gearmáinis, Béarla, Spáinnis, Iodáilis, Rúisis</b> nó <b>Fraincis)</b>.","t01-05-1":"5. — Tá an rang an-mhór agus an-solasmhar. Ag an gcúl tá <b>fuinneog</b> leathan le dhá <b>scáthlán</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.336662,0.236489,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"78\" title=\"scáthlán\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(78)</sup></button> agus <b>doras gloine</b>, chun é a aerú agus a shoilsiú.","t01-05-2":"Ní bhíonn fuacht sa rang seo. Sa lár, chun é a théamh, tá <b>sorn</b> an-mhaith <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543054,0.73567,0.011984,0.010809\" data-n=\"46\" title=\"furnelo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(46)</sup></button> lena <b>phíopa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.506214,0.622666,0.010431,0.011464\" data-n=\"45\" title=\"phíopa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(45)</sup></button>.","t01-05-3":"Sa landair tá <b>crúcaí</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.908566,0.720275,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"58\" title=\"crúcaí\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(58)</sup></button> buailte; orthu crochtar hataí agus cótaí na ndaltaí.","t01-tit-2":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">An Chlós.</span>","t01-06-1":"6. — Léiríonn an <b>clog</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.781846,0.21225,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"63\" title=\"clog\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(63)</sup></button> cúig nóiméad tar éis a naoi.","t01-06-2":"Tá an <b>sos</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.38016,0.384212,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"76\" title=\"sos\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(76)</sup></button> díreach thart, agus tá an ceacht ag tosú arís. Bíonn an sos sa <b>chlós</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.36285,0.442516,0.008655,0.010154\" data-n=\"75\" title=\"chlós\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(75)</sup></button>. Feicimid roinnt daltaí ag imirt. Tá an <b>maor</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.419441,0.372093,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"74\" title=\"maor\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(74)</sup></button> ag faire orthu.","t01-07-1":"7. — Sa chlós feicimid daoine eile freisin: an <b>cigire</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.400355,0.432689,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"73\" title=\"cigire\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(73)</sup></button>, an <b>stiúrthóir</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.47692,0.431379,0.008655,0.010809\" data-n=\"71\" title=\"stiúrthóir\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(71)</sup></button> agus an <b>ceann staidéir</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.441411,0.428431,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"72\" title=\"ceann staidéir\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(72)</sup></button>.","t01-07-2":"Scrúdaíonn an cigire na scoileanna, riarann an stiúrthóir an foras, agus faireann an ceann staidéir ar obair na ndaltaí.","t01-07-3":"Is é an ceathrú duine an <b>doirseoir</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.33644,0.429414,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"77\" title=\"doirseoir\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(77)</sup></button>. Iompraíonn sé an clár faoina ascaill, chun na daltaí atá as láthair a mharcáil.","t01-08-1":"8. — Ag cúl an chlóis tá na <b>fearais ghleacaíochta</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.467599,0.393384,0.009543,0.009826\" data-n=\"70\" title=\"fearais ghleacaíochta\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(70)</sup></button> agus ceardlann na <b>hoibre láimhe</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"hoibre láimhe\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>.","t01-08-2":"Ar dheis an tábla is ar éigean a fheictear <b>ranganna</b> an <b>cheoil</b> agus na <b>líníochta</b>.","t01-tit-3":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Cur síos mion.</span>","t01-tit-4":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Na daltaí maithe.</span>","t01-09-1":"9. — Is iad na daltaí ar an gcéad bhinse ar dheis na deisce ná <b>Anraí</b> <button class=\"apel\" data-noto=\"ga-t01-noto-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\">(*)</button>, <b>Stiofán</b> agus <b>Cathal</b>.","t01-09-2":"Tá Anraí an-aireach agus an-dícheallach; éisteann sé leis an múinteoir. Ar an mbord aige tá <b>cóipleabhar</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230581,0.868981,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"28\" title=\"cóipleabhar\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(28)</sup></button>, <b>leabhar</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.199068,0.863085,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"29\" title=\"leabhar\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(29)</sup></button>, <b>foclóir</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.159565,0.891582,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"30\" title=\"foclóir\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(30)</sup></button> agus <b>cás peann luaidhe</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.214603,0.905011,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"31\" title=\"cás peann luaidhe\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(31)</sup></button>. Ina leabhar tá go leor <b>leathanach</b>; i ngach caibidil tá roinnt <b>alt</b>, agus i ngach <b>líne</b> tá go leor <b>focal</b>.","t01-09-4":"Tá a chomharsa Stiofán <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.291389,0.81035,0.012206,0.010154\" data-n=\"24\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(24)</sup></button> saothrach. Tá sé ag scríobh sa chóipleabhar an cheachta atá tugtha don chéad uair eile. Tá <b>lámh scríbhneoireachta</b> den scoth aige. Tá a leabhar dúnta. Ní fheictear ach an <b>clúdach</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.201287,0.804455,0.010431,0.010809\" data-n=\"27\" title=\"clúdach\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(27)</sup></button>. Lena thaobh tá a <b>chompás</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.21771,0.820832,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"26\" title=\"chompás\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(26)</sup></button>.","t01-09-5":"Coinníonn Cathal <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.270084,0.730102,0.009987,0.011137\" data-n=\"23\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(23)</sup></button> an leabhar ina láimh; osclaíonn sé é chun an ceacht a athrá uair amháin eile. Mar a bhíonn ag gach dalta, tá <b>dúchán</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.241456,0.717982,0.011318,0.009826\" data-n=\"25\" title=\"dúchán\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(25)</sup></button> os a chomhair. Tá sé umhal.","t01-10-1":"10. — Ag an gcéad bhord eile suíonn <b>Labhrás, Antoine</b> agus <b>Pól</b>. Aithrisíonn Labhrás a <b>cheacht</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.365291,0.645922,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"22\" title=\"cheacht\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(22)</sup></button> agus freagraíonn sé <b>ceisteanna</b> an mhúinteora. Tá Antoine <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.329117,0.630855,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"21\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(21)</sup></button> an-neamhaireach; uaireanta pionósaíonn an múinteoir é fiú. Is <b>comrádaí</b> maith é Pól <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.334665,0.600721,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"20\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(20)</sup></button>, cairdiúil agus cabhrach. Tá sé an-aireach.","t01-tit-5":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Na daltaí dána.</span>","t01-11-1":"11. — Taobh thiar d’Anraí suíonn <b>Seoirse</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543276,0.87455,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"38\" title=\"Seoirse\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(38)</sup></button>. Ní buachaill olc é, ach tá sé <b>cainteach</b>, neamhaireach agus corrthónach. Cuireann a <b>éadromacht</b> agus a <b>easumhlaíocht</b> <b>mí-ord</b> sa cheacht, agus is minic a thuilleann sé <b>rabhadh</b> géar. Tá a <b>dhréacht</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.486906,0.885686,0.009987,0.010809\" data-n=\"35\" title=\"dhréacht\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(35)</sup></button> salach; déanann sé <b>smeadar dúigh</b> air lena <b>pheann</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.513316,0.936456,0.011762,0.008516\" data-n=\"34\" title=\"pheann\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(34)</sup></button>, agus dá bhrí sin bíonn a <b>scriosán</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.478695,0.859155,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"36\" title=\"scriosán\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(36)</sup></button> de shíor á úsáid aige; tá a <b>mhála scoile</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.454949,0.912217,0.010431,0.012119\" data-n=\"33\" title=\"mhála scoile\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(33)</sup></button> stróicthe, chomh míshlachtmhar sin atá sé. Cad chuige a dtugann sé a <b>pheann tobair</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.496671,0.864723,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"37\" title=\"pheann tobair\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(37)</sup></button> go rang na dteangacha nua-aimseartha?","t01-11-2":"Ní maith le Éamann <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.53573,0.800852,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"39\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(39)</sup></button>, a chomharsa, é. Is fíor go bhfuil sé beagán leisciúil, ach tá sé ciúin agus socair. Ní bhíonn sé ag caint; ach in ionad éisteacht, is fearr leis <b>scéalta</b> a léamh ina <b>leabhar léitheoireachta</b>.","t01-11-3":"Is é an tríú dalta ar an mbinse seo ná <b>Ludwig</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.483577,0.767114,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"40\" title=\"Ludwig\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(40)</sup></button>. Tá sé dícheallach. Scríobhann sé ar <b>bhileog pháipéir</b> bhán. Os a chomhair chuir sé an <b>páipéar súite</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.432091,0.739928,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"41\" title=\"páipéar súite\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(41)</sup></button>.","t01-12-1":"12. — Tá na daltaí ar an dara binse, ar chlé an mhúinteora, an-óg. An chéad duine, <b>Eimile</b> beag, níl sé in ann scríobh go maith fós; tugann sé leis a <b>shlinn</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.45162,0.655421,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"42\" title=\"shlinn\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(42)</sup></button>, a <b>pheann slinne</b> agus a <b>spúinse</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.627252,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"43\" title=\"spúinse\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(43)</sup></button>.","t01-12-2":"Lena thaobh tá <b>Ágastas</b> agus <b>Bearnard</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.591549,0.011984,0.009499\" data-n=\"44\" title=\"Bearnard\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(44)</sup></button>. Oibríonn an duine deireanach seo go maith, ach tá <b>cuma</b> an-mhíshlachtmhar air.","t01-13-1":"13. — Taobh thiar díobh suíonn triúr <b>leiscéirí</b>. Ní fhoghlaimíonn <b>Ailbe</b> a chuid ceachtanna. Bíonn <b>Séamas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.629161,0.611857,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"47\" title=\"Séamas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(47)</sup></button> ina chodladh in ionad éisteacht. Tarraingíonn a <b>leisce</b> <b>iomardaithe</b> agus <b>pionóis</b> fiú air. Faoi dheireadh, tá <b>Críostóir</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.679982,0.61153,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"48\" title=\"Críostóir\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(48)</sup></button> róéadrom. <b>Iompraíonn</b> sé é féin go holc agus ní dhéanann sé iarracht feabhas a chur air féin.","t01-14-1":"14. — A gcomharsana, os a choinne sin, iompraíonn siad iad féin go maith. Is maith le <b>Earnán</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699956,0.702588,0.007989,0.010809\" data-n=\"51\" title=\"Earnán\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(51)</sup></button> ord agus cruinneas; úsáideann sé i gcónaí a <b>riail</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.692632,0.793318,0.008877,0.010809\" data-n=\"50\" title=\"riail\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(50)</sup></button> agus a <b>pheann luaidhe</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.671993,0.744841,0.010209,0.009171\" data-n=\"49\" title=\"pheann luaidhe\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(49)</sup></button>. Is <b>dalta lae</b> é.","t01-14-2":"Is <b>cónaitheoir</b> é <b>Proinsias</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.780293,0.754012,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"52\" title=\"Proinsias\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(52)</sup></button>; caitheann sé éide, itheann sé agus codlaíonn sé san fhoras. Is <b>comrádaí</b> maith é.","t01-14-3":"Bíonn Muiris ag cur faobhair ar a <b>pheann luaidhe</b> lena <b>scian phóca</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.786951,0.886341,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"56\" title=\"scian phóca\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(56)</sup></button>; tá sé an-tíosach.","t01-14-4":"Tugann sé leis a chuid leabhar go léir, a <b>ghramadach</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.732801,0.892892,0.009543,0.010481\" data-n=\"55\" title=\"ghramadach\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(55)</sup></button>, a <b>leabhrán nótaí</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.709055,0.857845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"54\" title=\"leabhrán nótaí\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(54)</sup></button> agus fiú a <b>cheap nótaí</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.762761,0.880118,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"53\" title=\"cheap nótaí\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(53)</sup></button>. Tá a <b>mhála cáipéisí</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.930537,0.91451,0.010209,0.010809\" data-n=\"57\" title=\"mhála cáipéisí\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(57)</sup></button> ar an urlár taobh thiar de.","t01-14-5":"Tá an dá bhord ag cúl an ranga ag na <b>daltaí maithe</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.337772,0.507042,0.008433,0.010809\" data-n=\"19\" title=\"daltaí maithe\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(19)</sup></button>.","t01-tit-6":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">An líníocht agus an ceol.</span>","t01-15-1":"15. — I <b>rang na líníochta</b> tá <b>samplaí</b> áille ar crochadh ar an mballa, agus ón tsíleáil crochtar <b>lampa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.975144,0.45922,0.009765,0.010809\" data-n=\"62\" title=\"lampa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(62)</sup></button> lena <b>scáthlán</b>. Tá an <b>múinteoir</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.81447,0.575827,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"60\" title=\"múinteoir\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(60)</sup></button> an-fhoighneach; ceartaíonn sé <b>líníochtaí</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.891034,0.610219,0.007324,0.009826\" data-n=\"61\" title=\"líníochtaí\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(61)</sup></button> na ndaltaí agus múineann sé dóibh conas an <b>busta</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.976476,0.514248,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"59\" title=\"busta\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(59)</sup></button> a tharraingt ón nádúr.","t01-16-1":"16. — Dealraíonn <b>rang an cheoil</b> an-taitneamhach. Ann foghlaimítear conas na <b>nótaí</b> a léamh, conas <b>céimeanna an scála</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.753884,0.423845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"67\" title=\"céimeanna an scála\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(67)</sup></button> a chanadh — scríofa ar an <b>chláirseach cheoil</b> (do, re, mi, fa, sol, la, si = C. D. E. F. G. A. B.) — , conas na <b>eochracha</b> a aithint agus <b>foinn</b> áille a chanadh. Cuirtear na nótaí ar an <b>seastán</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.640257,0.466099,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"65\" title=\"seastán\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(65)</sup></button>. Bíonn duine de na daltaí <b>ag seinm an phianó</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.758766,0.510645,0.010652,0.010809\" data-n=\"64\" title=\"ag seinm an phianó\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(64)</sup></button>, agus bíonn <b>múinteoir an cheoil</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699512,0.461513,0.009099,0.010809\" data-n=\"66\" title=\"múinteoir an cheoil\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(66)</sup></button> <b>ag bualadh an ama</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.725477,0.447101,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"68\" title=\"ag bualadh an ama\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(68)</sup></button>.","t01-17-1":"17. — Is ar éigean a fheictear cúinne de cheardlann na <b>hoibre láimhe</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"hoibre láimhe\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>, mar a bhféadann na páistí foghlaim conas adhmad a locairt agus iarann a líomhadh. Ní bhíonn a leithéid i ngach scoil.","t01-tit-7":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Rang na n-eolaíochtaí nádúrtha.</span>","t01-18-1":"18. — Múineann múinteoir na matamaitice do na daltaí <b>céimseata,</b> <b>uimhríocht, áireamh</b> agus an <b>córas méadrach</b>. Sa tábla feicimid na príomhfhíoracha céimseata: an <b>ciorcal</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.019633,0.658661,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"ciorcal\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, an <b>cearnóg</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052468,0.626557,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"cearnóg\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, an <b>triantán</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.049811,0.67077,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"triantán\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button>, an <b>líne</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.035173,0.739874,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"líne\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-18-2":"Feicimid <b>oibríocht</b> freisin; ní <b>suimiú</b> é, ní <b>dealú</b> é ná <b>iolrú</b>: is <b>roinnt</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.065565,0.676005,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"roinnt\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button> é.","t01-19-1":"19. — I dtábla an chórais mhéadraigh feicimid: an <b>méadar</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052217,0.380286,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"méadar\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, an <b>scála</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.015161,0.379639,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"scála\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button> agus a chuid <b>meáchan</b>, an <b>lítear</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.059978,0.343932,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"lítear\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, an <b>deacailítear</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.013372,0.258796,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"deacailítear\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, an <b>deicilítear</b> agus an <b>méadar ciúbach</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.03224,0.324944,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"méadar ciúbach\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-19-2":"Foghlaimíonn na daltaí na <b>heolaíochtaí nádúrtha</b> freisin <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"táblaí balla\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(11)</sup></button> — zó-eolaíocht <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.124098,0.290533,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"zó-eolaíocht\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, luibheolaíocht <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.132317,0.3652,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"luibheolaíocht\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, geolaíocht <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.127443,0.431354,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"geolaíocht\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> — agus an <b>stair</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"táblaí balla\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(12)</sup></button>.","t01-19-3":"Sa chófra tá gléasanna don <b>fhisic</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"fhisic\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> agus don <b>cheimic</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230138,0.5755,0.009321,0.010481\" data-n=\"16\" title=\"cheimic\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(16)</sup></button>.","t01-19-4":"Ar an gcófra tá: an <b>sféar</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.189525,0.419915,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"14\" title=\"sféar\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(14)</sup></button>, an <b>cón</b> agus an <b>cruinneog</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.175322,0.387815,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"13\" title=\"cruinneog\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(13)</sup></button>.","t01-19-5":"Os cionn na dtáblaí tá <b>léarscáil</b> ar crochadh a léiríonn cúig chuid an domhain: an <b>Eoraip</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.161802,0.143808,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"Eoraip\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, an <b>Áise</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.20951,0.166394,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"g\" title=\"Áise\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(g)</sup></button>, an <b>Afraic</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.155821,0.230267,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"Afraic\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, <b>Meiriceá</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.073486,0.101258,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"Meiriceá\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button><button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.084585,0.148741,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"Meiriceá\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup> agus an <b>Aigéine</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.209077,0.256781,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"h\" title=\"Aigéine\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(h)</sup></button>, agus an dá aigéan mhóra — an <b>tAigéan Ciúin</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.036213,0.146461,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"tAigéan Ciúin\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> agus an <b>tAigéan Atlantach</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.116538,0.161832,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"tAigéan Atlantach\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>. <span class=\"fil\"></span>"},"noto":{"t01-noto-1":"(*) Do <i>na hainmneacha</i> freisin molaimid iad a thabhairt sa fhoirm Laidine. Sin an t-aon slí chun na hathruithe gan áireamh a sheachaint. Agus conas a roghnófaí idir <i>Giovanni, Jean, Johann, Jan, Hans, John, Eoin</i> agus a thuilleadh? Ní dhéanfaimid foclóir ar leith d’ainmneacha. Glacaimis leis an ainmneach Laidine agus abraimis: <b>Ioannes, Ioanna; Iulius, Iulia; Iakobus; Andreas; Lukas.</b> (Gramadach iomlán)."}}
